Error [E0957]: `embed_file` path escapes the project with `..`
  --> tests/ui/comptime_embed_dotdot.jet:1:7
    |
  1 | $d :: embed_file("../secret.txt")
    |       ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `..` could read files outside your project; comptime inputs must stay inside it
 Fix: drop the `..` and use a path under this file's directory

Error [E0107]: nothing named `$d` exists here
  --> tests/ui/comptime_embed_dotdot.jet:4:13
    |
  4 |     print("{$d}")
    |             ^^
 Why: a name must be declared before it's used
 Fix: declare it first: `$d :: ...`
